int of the rental agreement carefully.","wo":"Sooy luwe oto, njëkkal méngale njëkk a xool njëg yi nga mëna am yépp ba noppi, nga sooga tànn, nanga xool kontraa bi bu baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSooy loué auto, ndieukal mengalé ndieuk a khol ndieg yi nga meuna ame yeup ba noppi, nga soga tane, nanga khol contra bi bou bakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2612,"row":{"en":"As an entrepreneur, you have to perceive this and adapt to it.","wo":"Ndigam borom këru liggeykaay nga, warngaa raññe lii te tammalko sa bopp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdigueum borom keurou ligueyeukaay nga warnga ragné li té tamalko sa boppé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2613,"row":{"en":"If you follow the golden rule above, it's because you're trying to persuade someone.","wo":"Sooy topp sàrt yiñ tëral ci kaw, jàppal ni yaa ngi am kooy bëgga yay ci kàddu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSooy top sart yign teural thi kaw diapall ni ya ngui ame kooy beuga yay thi kadou\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2614,"row":{"en":"Islam is a religion that emphasizes surrender to the will of God.","wo":"Islam diine la bu jaam bi wara topp li soob Yàlla.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nIslam diiné la bou diam bi wara top li sob Yalla.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2615,"row":{"en":"However, when we allow our thoughts and actions to become chaotic and inconsistent, we experience inner conflict and turmoil.","wo":"Waaye sunu sànganee ba sunuy xalaat ak sunuy jëf ñàkka méngoo, noo ngi indi réeroo ak jaxasoo cu sunu biir.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé sounou sangané ba souniouy khalaat ak souniouy dieuf gnaka mengoo, no ngui indi réro ak diakhaso thi souniou biir.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2616,"row":{"en":"Just wait until you see the look on people's faces when they see my new tattoo!","wo":"Xaaral ba gis li nit ñi di wax wala def suñu gisee sama tatuwaas bu 