bi, ku nekk di nettali jaar-jaar yu neex yi ak kaf ak reetaan yu mu séqoon ak ki génn àdduna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMbok yi ak kharit weur keussou néw bi, kou nek di netali diar diar you nekh yi ak kaf ak réétane youmou sékhone ak ki guéne aduna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2650,"row":{"en":"The centre and rear speakers operate only in multi-channel surround mode.","wo":"Oparlër yu digg yi ak yi ci ginaaw duñu dox ludul su multi chaine yi nekkee ci mode surround.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nOparleur you digue yi ak yi thi guinaw dougnou dokh loudoul sou multi chaine yi néké thi mode surround.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2651,"row":{"en":"People need their illusions. They need to believe in something.","wo":"Nit ñi ñoo soxla nax seen bopp. Dañu soxla gëm dara.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNit gni nio sokhla nakh sen bopp. Dagnou sokhla geum dara.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2652,"row":{"en":"As the sun began to set, a young boy named Raman made his way home from school.","wo":"Bi jant bi tàmbali so, la xale bu góor bu tuddu Raman wàcci ekol di ñibbi seen kër.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi diant bi tambali soo, la khalé bou goor bou toudou raman wathié école di gnibi seen keur.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2653,"row":{"en":"They give people unrealistic expectations about love.","wo":"Li ñuy wan nit ñi ci mbëggeel dafa wuute ak li am.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi gnouy wan nitt gni si mbeuguel dafa wouté ak li ame.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2654,"row":{"en":"The dinner menu, though, is a far more refined affair in presentation and substance.","wo":"Alluwa reer bi, tamit, doona lu gena sell ci wallu siiwal ak jumtukaay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAlluwa reer bi tamite dooné lou geuna sell si wallou siwal ak jumtoukaye.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2655,"row":{"en":"The distribution of beauty services and spas is changing, with a growing number of men seeking out these services.","wo":"Liggéeyu ñiy toppatoo taar ak spa yi ñu ngi gëna bari góor ñu fay dem du wut ñu toppatoo seen yaram.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLiguéyou gni topato taar ak spa yi gnoungui geuna bari goor gnou fay dem dou wout gnou topato sen yaram.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2656,"row":{"en":"Finally, if you are planning to move your furniture around, be careful not to drag it across the floor, as this can also damage the surface.","wo":"Li may mujjee mooy sudee dangay waaja toxal say fótëy, nanga ko moytu diri ci dër bi, ndax loolu mën na yàq kaw dër bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLima mey moudié moy soudé dangay wadia tokhal say fotéy nanga ko moytou diri si deureu bi ndakh lolou meun na yakha kaw deureu bi\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2657,"row":{"en":"When the cake was finally finished, they took it to the premier of a new play that the linguist was translating.","wo":"Biñu defaree gato bi ba noppi, ñu yóbbu ko ci fi ñu doon njëkka wanee theatre bi jëkkër doon tekki.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBignou defaré gato bi ba noppi, gnou yobou ko thi fi gnou done ndieuka wané théatre bi dieukeur done tekki.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2658,"row":{"en":"The dog was a large, powerful breed that had been adopted from a shelter just a few months before the attack.","wo":"Xaj bu ngand la woon, nekk raas bu am doole, dañu ko adoptee ci làquwaay yàggul dara ci la songe.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhaj bou ngand la wone nek raas bou ame dolé daniou ko adopté ci laquway yaggoul dara thi la songe.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2659,"row":{"en":"It’s not fake news, not trying to fool anyone, it’s just a joke and it cheered up my January a bit.","wo":"Du xibaar bu wérul, jéemul nax kenn, ay kaf rekk la te neexal na tuuti sama weeru janvier.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDou khibaar bou weroul djémoul nakh kénn ay kaf rek la té nékhal na touti sama wérou janvier.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2660,"row":{"en":"If you're in a seriously cold climate, try it with a classic sweater, cozy scarf, and ankle boots instead.","wo":"Soo nekkee ci fu sedd lool, jéemal sos puloweer bu yàgg, kaala gu nugg ak dàll yu yekk sa tëstën.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo nekkee thi fou sedd lool, djémal soss puloweur bou yagg, kaala gou nugg ak dall you yeuk sa teusten.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2661,"row":{"en":"Finally, my high school experience helped me to develop a strong work ethic and a commitment to excellence.","wo":"Fi may jeexale mooy lima jàngee liise jàppale nama ma xam liggéey bu jaar yoon ak fonk liggéey bu mucc ayib.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFi may diekhalé moy lima diangué lycée diapalé nama ma kham liguey bou diar yone ak fonk liguey bou mutch ayib.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2662,"row":{"en":"Paul offered to pick her up, but Jan wasn’t telling him where she lived.","wo":"Paul dafa bëggoon yóbbaale Jan waaye moom Jan nangu wo ko wax fi mu dëkk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPaul dafa beugone yobalé Jan wayé mom Jan nangou woko wakh fi mou deuk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2663,"row":{"en":"Early diagnosis and treatment is important to prevent serious complications.","wo":"Su ñu ko teelee gis ba noppi teel ko faj dina tax ba du indi yeneen jafe-jafe.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou gnou ko télé guiss ba noppi tél ko fadje dina takh ba dou indi yénéne diafé-diafé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2664,"row":{"en":"He landed in a big pile of manure, and the snake slid right past him.","wo":"Mu daanu ci jalu neefere, jaan ji daal di koy romb dem yoonam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou danou si djialou néféré, djian dji daldi koy rombe dem yoname.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2665,"row":{"en":"It makes up over 60% of our body weight and is involved in many important bodily functions, such as regulating body temperature, transporting nutrients and oxygen to cells, and removing waste products.","wo":"Lu ëpp 60% ci sunu yaram ndax la, te barina lu am solo lu muy liggéey ci sunu yaram, lu ci melni yamale tàngooru yaram, yóbbu ferñeent yi ak oxygen ci selul yi, ak dindi yi baaxul ci yaram.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLou eup 60% si souniou yaram ndakh la té barina lou am solo loumouy liguey si souniou yaram, lou si melni yamalé tangoorou yaram, yobou fergneent yi ak oxygene si seloul yi ak dindi yi bakhoul si yaram.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2666,"row":{"en":"Woman: I know what you mean.","wo":"Ku jigéen ki: Xamnaa li nga bëgga wax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou djiguéne ki khamna li nga beuga wakh\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2667,"row":{"en":"Customer: I'm mostly interested in something neutral and understated.","wo":"Kiliyaan bi: Lima gënal mooy lu fësul lool te seerul.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nClient bi: lima gueunal moye lou feussoul lol té seroul.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2668,"row":{"en":"Mother: Sure, but be careful not to bump it.","wo":"Yaay ji: Waawaw, waaye moytu ko dóor fenn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYaye dji: wawaw wayé moytouko door fénn.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2669,"row":{"en":"He quickly backed away, but the snake was already on the move.","wo":"Mu daal di gaaw dellu ginaaw, waaye fekk jaan jaa ngi koy waaja song.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou daldi gaw dellou guinaw wayé fekk djane dja ngui koy wadia songe.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2670,"row":{"en":"It is important to get at least 150 minutes of moderate-intensity aerobic activity or 75 minutes of vigorous-intensity aerobic activity each week.","wo":"Dafa am solo nga def 150 simili aerobic yu yamamaay, wala 75 simili aerobic yu tar ayu-bis bu nekk soo bëggee am wérgi-yaram.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa am solo nga def 150 simili aerobic you yamamay, wala 75 simili aerobic you tar ayou bisse bou nek so beugué ame wergui yaram.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2671,"row":{"en":"Ms. Smith, I said, I'm really looking forward to the food and wine festival this weekend.","wo":"Mani ko Soxna Smith, maa ngi waajal bu baax lekk yi ak vin yi ci festival bi ci njeexte ayu-bis bii.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMani ko sokhna smith mangui wadial bou bakh lekk yi ak vin yi si festival bi si ndiekhté ayou biss bii.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2672,"row":{"en":"But now, it was retired, its days of sailing over.","wo":"Waaye leegi wàccina liggéey, dootul demati biir géej.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé légui wathiana liguey, dotoul demati biir guedj.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2673,"row":{"en":"The town was small and quiet.","wo":"Dëkk bu ndaw la bu bariwul coow.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDeuk bou ndaw la bou bariwoul thiow.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2674,"row":{"en":"You must also learn to be humble.","wo":"Danga wara nekk nit ku woyof.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDanga wara nek nitt kou woyof rek.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2675,"row":{"en":"It is to learn to accommodate all that is, said the old woman.","wo":"Jigéen ju mag ji tontu ko, mooy nga jàng mëna muñ lépp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjiguéne djou mag dji tontou ko moy nga diang meuna mougn lépé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2676,"row":{"en":"Mum! Dad! I cry. There’s something outside!","wo":"Ma yuuxu, yaay! pàppa! amna lu nekk ci biti!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa youkhou yay papa amna lou nek thi biti !\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2677,"row":{"en":"From the bustling cities of Lagos and Abuja to the more rural areas of the country, there is no one-size-fits-all description of what a typical day in Nigeria is like.","wo":"Liko dalee ci dëkki taax yu mag yu melni Lagos ak Abuja ba ci dëkk yi gëna àlle, amul benn tegtal buñu mëna wax ni mën na fësal li doomu Nigeria di def ci bis bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLiko dalé thi deuki taakh you mag you melni Lagos ak Abuja ba thi deuk yi geuna alle amoul ben tegtal bougnou meuna wakh ni meun na feusal li domou Nigeria di def thi biss bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2678,"row":{"en":"We can all help to stop animal cruelty by being more aware of the issue and by speaking out against it.","wo":"Ku nekk ci nun mën na jàppale baayima ñu bañ leen def yëfi soxor, su ku nekk yëkkate kàddoom ngir ñaawlu ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou nek si gnoune meun na diapalé bayima gnou bagn len def yeufi sohor, sou kou nek yeukaté kadom nguir niawlou ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2679,"row":{"en":"We recharged our batteries with a glimpse of sunshine, crab sandwiches and a boat trip.","wo":"Ci tuuti naaj biñ am lañu sarse sunu batëri, defar sandwich krab ak ci tukkib bato.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCi touti nadj bign am lagnou sarsé souniou bateri, defar sandwich krab ak ci toukkib bato.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2680,"row":{"en":"It's so sad, he said. I can't imagine how the families of the victims are coping.","wo":"Muni, Lu tiis la woon, mënu ma xalaat li mbokki ñi ci loru nara dundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMounii, Lou tiiss la wone, meunouma khalaat li mbokki gni thi loru nara doundou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2681,"row":{"en":"The next time you are tempted to judge something by its appearance, take a moment to pause and reflect.","wo":"Beneen yoon soo naree dëkkal nit fumu dëkkul, toogal nga xalaat bu baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBeneen yone so naré deukal nitt foumou deukoul togual nga khalat bou bakh\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2682,"row":{"en":"Let us come together as one people and build a better future for all.","wo":"Nanu booloo nekk wenn askan, liggéey ngir ëlëg gëna neex ci ñépp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNagnou booloo nek wenn askane, liguey nguir euleuk geuna nekh si nieupé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2683,"row":{"en":"highlight","wo":"biral li gën a fës","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nbiral li gueun a feuss\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2684,"row":{"en":"The trolls created fake accounts and used them to post pro-Trump messages and anti-Hillary Clinton messages.","wo":"Trol yi dañu sos kontu yu baaxul ba noppi jëfandikoo leen ngir siiwal mesaas yuy faral Trump, di xeex Hillary Clinton.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTrol yi daniou sos kontou you bakhoul ba nopi dieufandiko léne nguir siwal mesaas youy faral trump di khekh hillary clinton.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2685,"row":{"en":"Processes outgoing mail, maintains files, orders supplies, and ships packages.","wo":"Mooy yonnee mail yiy dem, yor fichier yi, def komànd yi ba noppi yóbbante koli yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoy yoné mail yiy dem, yorr fichier yi, def command yi ba noppi yobanté colis yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2686,"row":{"en":"We were all so proud of our work, and we couldn't wait to share the delicious vegetables with our family and friends.","wo":"Bégoon nanu lool ci sunu liggéey, te itam yàkkamti woon nanu lool séddoo lujum yu neex yi ak sunuy mbokk ak xarit.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBegone nagnou loool si sounou liguey té itam yakamti wone nagnou loool seddoo loujum you nekh yi ak souniou mbok ak kharit.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2687,"row":{"en":"Jogging is a full-body workout that works wonders on the thigh muscles and keeps your heart pumping.","wo":"Jogging wala daw, nekk na tàggat yaram bu baax ci sisiti pooj ak dafay gëna dundal sa xët.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nJogging walla daw nek na taggat yaram bou bakh thi sisiti podj ak dafay geuna doundal sa khet.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2688,"row":{"en":"The plot had a female doctor hire seven mercenaries to defend an intellectually disabled boy from a lynching.","wo":"Ni mbind mi waroon tëddee mooy benn medecin bu jigéen moo jël juróom ñaari merseneer ñu wàllu xale bu xelam neexul buñu naroon duma.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNi mbinde mi warone teudé moy bene médecin bou djiguéne mo dieul diourom gnari mercenaire gnou wallou khalé bou khélam nékhoul bougnou narone douma.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2689,"row":{"en":"Rum can also be used in more creative cocktails, such as the Hemingway Daiquiri or the Painkiller.","wo":"Dañuy jëfandikoo rhum itam ci yeneen xeetu njaxas yu ci memni Hemingway Daiquiri wala Painkiller.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDagnouy dieufandiko rhum itam thi yenen khettou ndjakhass you thi memni Hemingway Daiquiri wala Painkiller.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2690,"row":{"en":"November 25 Wait-listed applicants informed of acceptance status.","wo":"25 nowàmbar lañu génne listu ñi ñu may këyit ñi doon xaar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\n25 nowambar lagnou guéné listou gni gnou may keuyit gni done khar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2691,"row":{"en":"As they approached the finish line, the lead changed hands several times.","wo":"Bi ñuy waaye yegsi rëddu njeexte gi, ñuy rawante lu bari seen biir.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi gnuy wayé yeksi reudou ndiekhté gui, gnuy rawanté lou bari sen biir.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2692,"row":{"en":"Tried by this measure, how shall we judge the present state of science?","wo":"Buñ sukkandikoo ci nattukaay bii, naka lañu mëna xaymaa tolluwaayu science ci jamono jii?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBougnou soukandiko si nattoukay bii naka lagnou meuna khayma tollouwayou science bii si diamono dji ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2693,"row":{"en":"Child: Wow, it's so beautiful!","wo":"Xale bi: Waaw, aka rafet!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalé bi: waw aka raféte !\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2694,"row":{"en":"Solenne freezes in the threshold, her body stiff like a statue, as she stares toward the metro platform.","wo":"Solenne dafa melni ku liw taxaw buntu bi, yaram wi waw kong mu jubal ci gaaru metro bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSolenne dafa melni kou liw takhaw bountou bi, yaram wi waw kong mou djoubal si gaarou metro bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2695,"row":{"en":"Science is a systematic enterprise that builds and organizes knowledge in the form of testable explanations and predictions about the natural world.","wo":"Science, liggéey la bu lalu ci sistem, muy tabax di nas ay xam-xam ci anamu joxe leeral, wax luy waaja ñëw te ñu mën ko saytu ci àdduna bi boroom bi sàkk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nScience liguey leu bou lalou si system, mouy tabakh di nass ay kham-kham ci anamou diokhé leeral, wakh louy wadia nieuw té gnou meun ko saytou ci addouna bi borom bi sak.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2696,"row":{"en":"Fuel pump relay wiring diagram (automatic transmission only).","wo":"Semaawu kablaasu fiilu pompu essence (transmisioŋ otomatik kese).","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSemaawou kablassou fiilou pompe essence (transmision otomatik kessé).\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2697,"row":{"en":"I also try to eat fruits and vegetables throughout the day.","wo":"Ci bis bi dina jéema lekk ay fruit aki lujum.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi biss bi dina djéma lekeu ay fruit akie lidioum.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2698,"row":{"en":"I'm glad that Abel and I decided to donate blood.","wo":"Man ak Adel kontaan nañu lool binu mayee deret.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMane ak adel contane nagnou lol bignou mayé déret.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2699,"row":{"en":"You can also search by location.","wo":"Mën nga itam seetee ci barab.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nga itam seté thi barab\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]}],"num_rows_total":3438,"num_rows_per_page":100,"partial":false}